 "Kharos was built to keep time for a city that no longer exists. The city fell and its clocks stopped, but the Hourglass Sentinel still walks its rounds through the empty squares: a bronze giant with a cracked hourglass where its heart should be, the sand inside running upward.\n\nIt fights the way a clock strikes, on the beat and without mercy. Its blade sweeps a half-circle before it like a second hand, and the hero it chooses is held fast while the moment around them stops. Every few seconds it turns the glass, and whatever binds its allies simply runs out.": "Kharos 被造來為一座早已不存在的城市守時。城市陷落，鐘錶停擺，沙漏哨兵卻仍在空蕩的廣場上巡行：一尊青銅巨像，心臟的位置嵌著一只開裂的沙漏，裡面的沙向上流。\n\n它戰鬥起來如同鐘聲報時：踩著節拍，毫不留情。它的刀刃像秒針一樣在身前掃出半圓，被它選中的英雄會被定在原地，周圍的時光隨之停止。每隔幾秒它便翻轉沙漏，束縛它盟友的一切就此流盡。"
